html='''<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hant"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>森林生物圖鑑</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;padding:42px 52px;background:#10262b;color:#f2e7c5;font-family:"Microsoft JhengHei",sans-serif}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}h1{font-size:38px;margin:12px 0}small{color:#e7bd67;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:11px}p{font-size:13px;color:#a5bcb0;line-height:1.8}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}.card{background:#1b3739;border:1px solid #3a5951;padding:20px;border-top:3px solid #d5b365}.card img{width:100%;height:210px;object-fit:contain}.card h2{font-size:20px;margin:12px 0 6px}.tag{font-size:11px;color:#92c3a0}.card p{font-size:12px;margin:0}.foot{border-top:1px solid #3a5951;margin-top:28px;padding-top:15px}a{color:#e7bd67}@media(max-width:850px){.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}body{padding:24px}}</style><header><div><small>FOREST BESTIARY / CHARACTER DESIGN V2</small><h1>森林裡，每一隻都有自己的脾氣。</h1><p>Q 版低模切面 · 四種小怪 / 兩種小王 / 次王 / 大王</p></div><a href="../MONSTERS.md">外型與動作規格 ↗</a></header><div class="grid">'''
